<title>NORWAY: Norway's Dec foreign trade surplus NOK 9.27 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway's Dec foreign trade surplus NOK 9.27 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statstics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	DEC 1996    NOV 1996    DEC 1995</p>
<p> Imports			    18.30	 18.92	 15.75</p>
<p> Exports			    27.57	 29.34	 22.57</p>
<p> Balance			     9.27	 10.42	  6.82</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		-6.08	 -5.30	 -4.27</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
